          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിഷേധിക്കുക — niṣēdhikkuka — \"to deny\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവൻ ആ വാർത്ത നിഷേധിച്ചു. avan ā vārtta niṣēdhiccu. He denied that news report."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: നിഷേധിച്ചു, niṣēdhiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is നിഷേധം, a denial; നിഷേധിക്കുക (niṣēdhikkuka) can also mean to refuse a thing to someone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിഷേധിക്കുക (niṣēdhikkuka) is built from Sanskrit niṣedha, \"warding off, prevention, prohibition\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക. To deny is to push a claim away."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
