          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവകാശപ്പെടുക — avakāśappeṭuka — \"to claim\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആ ഭൂമി തന്റേതാണെന്ന് അയാൾ അവകാശപ്പെട്ടു. ā bhūmi tanṟētāṇennŭ ayāḷ avakāśappeṭṭu. He claimed that the land was his."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: അവകാശപ്പെട്ടു, avakāśappeṭṭu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on അവകാശം, a right: to claim is to say a right is yours. What is claimed comes before എന്ന്."
            }
          ]
        },
